                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.00/2613: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-05T15:00:00-05:00">December 5, 1929—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>61. Your 91, December 4, 2 p.m. Please withhold proclamation. I am sending you a
                    long personal message with my views later this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
